        "title": "Swiss Chard",
        "anchor": "swiss_chard",
        "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): -5°C - 26°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)Hydration$(): 40 - 80 %$(br)$(bold)Category$(): Vegetable$(br2)$(bold)$(3)Nitrogen$(): 60 $(bold)$(6)Phosphorous$(): 20 $(bold)$(d)Potassium$(): 40$()$(br2)Swiss Chard is a single block crop: thick stalks and broad leaves.$(br2)Swiss Chard seeds can be planted on $(l:tfc:food/farmland)farmland$(), and once ripe the harvest gives $(thing)Swiss Chard$() and $(thing)Swiss Chard Seeds$().$(br2)"
      },
      "BookPages": 174
    },
    {
      "Path": "assets/tfc/patchouli_books/field_guide/en_us/entries/farming_plus/wild_crops.json",
      "Index": 10,
      "Page": {
        "type": "patchouli:text",
        "title": "Wild Swiss Chard",
        "anchor": "swiss_chard",
        "text": "Can be found in regions with: $(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)Temperature$(): -5°C - 26°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#rainfall)Rainfall$(): 160 - 320mm$(br2)Seeds collected here can be sown on $(l:tfc:farming_plus/crops)farmland$(); as a crop it needs temperature -5°C - 26°C and hydration 40 - 80 %."
      },
      "BookPages": 87
    },
    {
      "Path": "assets/tfc/patchouli_books/field_guide/zh_cn/entries/farming_plus/crops.json",
      "Index": 20,
      "Page": {
        "type": "patchouli:text",
        "title": "牛皮菜",
        "anchor": "swiss_chard",
        "text": "$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): -5°C - 26°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:food/hydration)湿度$(): 40 - 80 %$(br)$(bold)类别$(): 蔬菜类$(br2)$(bold)$(3)氮$(): 60 $(bold)$(6)磷$(): 20 $(bold)$(d)钾$(): 40$()$(br2)牛皮菜是单格作物。叶柄肥厚、叶片宽大，割了还会再长。$(br2)牛皮菜种子可以种植在$(l:tfc:food/farmland)农田$()上，成熟后收割可以得到$(thing)牛皮菜$()和$(thing)牛皮菜种子$()。$(br2)"
      },
      "BookPages": 174
    },
    {
      "Path": "assets/tfc/patchouli_books/field_guide/zh_cn/entries/farming_plus/wild_crops.json",
      "Index": 10,
      "Page": {
        "type": "patchouli:text",
        "title": "野生牛皮菜",
        "anchor": "swiss_chard",
        "text": "可在下列区域找到：$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): -5°C - 26°C$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#rainfall)降水$(): 160 - 320mm$(br2)采到的种子播在$(l:tfc:farming_plus/crops)农田$()上即可栽培；栽培条件为温度 -5°C - 26°C、湿度 40 - 80 %。"
      },
      "BookPages": 87
    }
